Meta.documentation:String.replace
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Replaces every occurrence of a search String with another.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Takes three inputs — subject, search, replacement — in flow
Meta.documentation:order ([String:hello String:l String:L]) or pre-positioned
Meta.documentation:as parameters (?|search=l&|replacement=L). Emits as soon as
Meta.documentation:all three are present.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_String_subject — the String to change
Meta.documentation:@port in_String_search — the text to look for
Meta.documentation:@port in_String_replacement — the text that replaces it
Meta.documentation:@port out_String_default — the result
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:[String:hello String:l String:L]>>String.replace:>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:heLLo
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:String:hello>>String.replace:?|search=l&|replacement=L>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:heLLo
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@see String.substring String.split
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status stable

[Native.Javascript:const%20Resource%20%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Content-Type%2Fdata%2FResource%22)%3B%0A%0A%2F%2F%20Replaces%20all%20occurrences%20of%20a%20search%20String%20with%20a%20replacement%20String.%0A%2F%2F%20Inputs%20may%20flow%20in%20order%20%5Bsubject%2C%20search%2C%20replacement%5D%20or%20be%0A%2F%2F%20pre-positioned%20with%20parameters%3A%20String%3Ahello%3E%3EString.replace%3A%3F%7Csearch%3Dl%26%7Creplacement%3DL%0Afunction%20replace()%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.call(this%2C%22replace%22)%3B%0A%09this.Processor%3DreplaceProcessor%3B%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20replaceProcessor(resource)%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.Processor.call(this%2Cresource)%3B%20%0A%09this.resource%20%3D%20resource%3B%0A%09this.out_String_default%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09this.in_begin%20%3D%20function()%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09this.subject%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09%09this.search%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09%09this.replacement%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09%09this.emitted%20%3D%20false%3B%0A%09%09return%20this.fire_end_parameters()%3B%20%2F%2F%20pre-positioned%20parameter%20inputs%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%09this.tryEmit%20%3D%20function()%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09if%20(!this.emitted%20%26%26%20this.subject%20!%3D%3D%20null%20%26%26%20this.search%20!%3D%3D%20null%20%26%26%20this.replacement%20!%3D%3D%20null)%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09this.emitted%20%3D%20true%3B%0A%09%09%09return%20this%3F.out_String_default%3F.(%7Bvalue%3Athis.subject.split(this.search).join(this.replacement)%7D)%3B%0A%09%09%7D%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%09this.in_String_subject%20%3D%20function(input)%20%7B%20this.subject%20%3D%20input.value%3B%20return%20this.tryEmit()%3B%20%7D%0A%09this.in_String_search%20%3D%20function(input)%20%7B%20this.search%20%3D%20input.value%3B%20return%20this.tryEmit()%3B%20%7D%0A%09this.in_String_replacement%20%3D%20function(input)%20%7B%20this.replacement%20%3D%20input.value%3B%20return%20this.tryEmit()%3B%20%7D%0A%09this.in_end%20%3D%20function()%20%7B%20return%20this.tryEmit()%3B%20%7D%0A%7D%0Areplace.Processor%3DreplaceProcessor%3B%0Amodule.exports%3Dreplace%3B]>>NewResource:String.replace
